      "content": "The first part of your summary regarding the scientific community is pretty detailed, but it feels a bit lopsided compared to the civil liberties section. Could you expand on the advocates' side? I'm looking for the specific legal or ethical principles they rely on, rather than just a general mention of personal choice.",
