      "content": "Thanks. Looking back at your first response, though, you said mandates \"are a clear demonstration of where the government must intervene for the greater good.\" That sounds pretty definitive. If someone were arguing that the harm to civil liberties is actually more significant than the public health benefit, how would you describe their position? Or do you think the scientific necessity makes the liberty argument fundamentally invalid?",
